      "releaseNotes": "hey siri, what's the groove number of this song?\n\n- siri: say \"what's the groove number of this song\" and the recorder opens, then stops on its own once it has a reading. \"start listening in groove number\" opens live. \"what was the last groove number\" tells you the last reading without opening the app.\n- shortcuts: a new analyze audio file action gives you swing, bpm and key for any file, on device, so one shortcut can tag a whole folder of samples. open in groove number sends a file straight to analyze.\n- smaller iphones: the view picker and the midi button no longer get cut off.\n\nsame on-device analysis. no account, no upload.",
